  "documented_gaps": {
    "PREPROD_PROVIDER_CONTROL_PLANE_ABSENT": "The preprod public-v1 profile declares only group.* and session.* route_bindings. It exposes no Provider registration/admin routes (/providers, /providers/{id}/bots), no parent-discovery or Provider callback bindings, and no provider_admin_token credential channel in any auth.header_env. Remote preprod execution of this story is unsupported by design, not by missing effort; remote_validation stays NOT_RUN and grants_release_credit is false."
